  "title": "Heather's Grilled Salmon",
  "description": "A simple marinade of brown sugar and soy sauce is jazzed up with the addition of lemon pepper and some dried herbs. Grilled salmon never tasted so good!",
  "authors": [
    "Heather Waldron"
  ],
